# Excerpt of FreeCAD's official CalculiX golden result file
# src/Mod/Fem/femtest/data/calculix/box_static.frd (ccx 2.11, static, 280 nodes).
# Vendored as the positive anchor for _frd_has_results: it preserves the real
# ordering, in which 1PSTEP precedes the 100CL header it belongs to and is NOT
# adjacent to it. Hand-written fixtures got this backwards and let a detector
# that fails on real output pass the tests. Value lines are truncated for size;
# only the block structure matters to the parser. Do not reorder these lines.
